stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending
    pending --> running: prerequisites satisfied
    pending --> needs_input: missing decision or capability
    pending --> cancelled
    running --> completed: validated commit
    running --> retry_wait: safe transient failure
    running --> paused: quota or recoverable block
    running --> needs_input: intervention
    running --> interrupted: uncertain completion
    running --> failed: terminal failure
    running --> cancelled: stopped and reconciled
    retry_wait --> pending: backoff elapsed
    retry_wait --> paused: retry budget exhausted
    retry_wait --> cancelled
    paused --> pending: condition restored
    paused --> needs_input
    paused --> cancelled
    needs_input --> pending: decision recorded
    needs_input --> cancelled
    interrupted --> completed: completion confirmed
    interrupted --> pending: safe replay established
    interrupted --> paused
    interrupted --> needs_input
    interrupted --> failed
    interrupted --> cancelled
    completed --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
